| `attr.parse_args_with(...)`           | `attr.parse_args_with(...)` (same)         |

**Docs:**  
- [syn::Attribute docs syn 2.0](https://docs.rs/syn/2/syn/struct.Attribute.html)
- [Meta docs](https://docs.rs/syn/2/syn/enum.Meta.html)

